Touch this file to force Vercel to run a real build.

Vercel skips builds when a commit changes nothing inside the project's
Root Directory (artifacts/web-app). Environment variable changes alone do
not count, so a dashboard change to VITE_API_SERVER_URL will not take
effect until a commit touches a file in this directory.

